{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵一族吗……”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4621", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐很担心的样子。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐下午就去打工了。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "社团教室里只剩我和纱凪两人。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我们的距离自然就变得很近。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我也是很担心熊喵喔。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4622", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，嗯，我知道。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一说出学姐的名字，纱凪就气鼓了脸颊。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随即她像回过神来似的抱头烦恼。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，我太丑陋了。居然忌妒美羽学姐……”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4623", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果不会被忌妒也是蛮寂寞的就是了。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾忌妒人过吗？”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4624", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算想忌妒，但我女朋友讨厌男人……”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊，对喔！？……为什么只有我抱着这么丑陋的忌妒，我不高兴。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4625", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有没有让新吾忌妒的方法呢……”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4626", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，我有忌妒过喔。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“比如第一次听你说戒指的事情时。就在想是什么样的男人送你的……”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，这个？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4627", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪拿出手机上挂着的戒指，坏坏地笑了。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼嗯～新吾也会忌妒啊。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4628", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果有别人为纱凪的手指戴上戒指，那我真的会忌妒到丑陋。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，我不会让新吾以外的人戴啦。应该说，希望你戴……”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4629", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，我居然这么不擅长这种事！”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4630", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该再多讲几句让新吾忌妒，或者说，我得提升这方面的程度才行……”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4631", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我希望你维持这样就好了……”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我真心这么想。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是纱凪再说出更多刺激我的言论，我就很难克制自己了。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好吧。反正耍小心机什么的不是我的个性。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4632", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且我就是喜欢你，忌妒有什么不对！”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4633", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪豁出去了，她抱住我的手臂。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，我希望你安心。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？安心……”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6862", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我觉得你会忌妒，就代表我还不够爱纱凪，所以没办法让你安心。”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那个，不是那种意思……应该说，啊啊脸靠太近了啦！”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6863", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一下子靠近一下子远离。纱凪现在很慌乱吧。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……已经爱得很够了。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4636", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说让我太尽情撒娇的话……大概，会坏掉……”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4637", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这我明白。我也不想做会让她坏掉的事情。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以要掌握分寸……", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂喂！不要摸我的头……这么温柔，我会……”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4638", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……想做的啊……”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4639", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不问她想做什么。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "手指抚上她的脸，纱凪就眨着水汪汪的大眼一动也不动。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、等、新……吾……”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4640", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我亲她的脸颊，接着是额头、眼皮。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "揽过她的腰，纱凪便软软地依偎在我胸口。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就这样重复着轻轻的亲吻。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是只有嘴唇不吻，看着纱凪的表情越来越迷蒙。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼啊……啊啊啊……”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6866", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "等到我停止亲吻，她已经彻底陶醉了。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样还会忌妒吗？”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会了……抱歉、新吾……我……要融化了……”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6867", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯……呼……”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6868", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后我吻了她的唇，将她抱紧。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她一点一点地沁入我的体内。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也沁入她的。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "彼此都想感受只用吻还不够表达的爱情。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊……就、就说我要、融化了──”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6869", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好可爱，我最喜欢你了，纱凪。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊……这、这种时候……听到……那些话……呼、呼唔……”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6870", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“笨蛋、笨蛋、笨蛋新吾……嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6871", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……我再吻你一次喔……”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯唔唔……已经……不行……啾、啾咕……”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6872", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪不擅长恋爱的小心机。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾……嗯嗯、啾姆、嗯啾、啾……”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6873", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她只会坦率地传达与接受心意。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我会尽可能地，直到极限。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……纱凪……喜欢你……嗯、啾……”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈嗯、嗯呼……嗯、嗯……真的、已经、不行……不行了……啾咕、啾……”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6874", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，就算方式不同，我们都一样不擅长表达感情。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……谢谢你送我，渣男。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4645", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“最、最后那是？”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为你就是渣男嘛，男人真是烂透了……”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4646", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想起了社团教室里的事，纱凪害羞地转身背对我。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你只会对我做那种事情吧？”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4647", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然只对纱凪。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4648", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我也……只会让新吾做那种事……”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4649", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我知道。”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊，喂……”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4650", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我从背后抱住她，纱凪吓得抖了一下。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这也是只对纱凪。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂、喂！不要来拐我……”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4651", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是跟话语相反，纱凪已经放松身体靠在我身上。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻地把她转过来。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……今天的新吾，是不是太大胆了？”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4652", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是吗？”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我……说了忌妒的话题？”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4653", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这的确是个很大的因素。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，最重要的还是我对纱凪的感情一天比一天更强了。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算克制自己，我还是不停地像胆小鬼赛局那样寻找极限。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……因为这样的纱凪可爱到我受不了。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“变得越来越喜欢你……嗯，而且老实说……还不够。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在也是。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪抬起眼眸注视着我。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6875", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，太黏人了很烦吧？”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不会，但是……那个……”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6876", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“单方面被新吾拐太不甘心了，所以我也要拐新吾。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4656", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我要让新吾对我着迷。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4657", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我已经被你拐得对你深深着迷了。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概比纱凪想像得更深。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "稍微一松懈我就会做出比接吻更超过的事情。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊唔……因、因为那种事情你都自然地看着眼睛说，所以我才总是有被你拐的感觉。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6877", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我克制一下吧。”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不用克制也没关系啊……”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6878", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她低声说，又把身体更依偎在我身上。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这样啊。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯……呼……”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6879", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "晚上很冷，我们还是尽早回家比较好。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我抱着纱凪不放，她也回抱着我。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们今天也是迟迟无法分开。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是……我得比起现在更用心拐新吾才行。”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "sn6880", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“让你不会跟美羽学姐出轨。”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4660", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不可能那样做。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我正想反驳，但随即注意到不管我说什么都没用。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很明白对纱凪来说，美羽学姐的存在有多么巨大。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管我怎么说，都只是类似暂时的止痛药。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我决定不要自己说出美羽学姐的名字。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，对了。后天社团活动结束后有时间吗？”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4661", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我没其他安排……”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那可以陪我一下吗？”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4662", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你有什么事要做吗？”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到那天为止保密。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4663", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之要把时间空下来喔，知道了吗？”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_sn4664", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“了解。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然在意是什么事，不过当作惊喜期待也不错。", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们在纱凪家门前聊了好一会。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喜悦让我们脸上始终带着笑容。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我与纱凪分开，走向回家的方向。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不自觉加快了脚步。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请参考看看～不好意思，请参考看看～”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3330", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住确认了一下时间。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐今天打工到这么晚吗……", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我停下脚步，看了她一会。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，新吾君！”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3331", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对上视线，学姐笑着走向我。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼，你在社团教室待到这么晚吗？”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3332", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不是……”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你喔，我也想说结束后去一趟社团♪”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3333", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "胸口有点痛。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟纱凪交往明明不是坏事。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，你还好吗？打工到这么晚……”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，已经很习惯了♪”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3334", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有这个打扮也习惯了。”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3335", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐笑着，没有表现出一丝疲惫。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说等一下还要去社团，真的没问题吗？", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且这个时期晚上很冷，她这副打扮……", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3336", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君，怎么了？”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3337", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……没事。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我捏着自己的外套，动不了。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "脑海里浮现了纱凪的脸。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果我现在把外套借给美羽学姐……", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，抱歉喔，在这种地方站着说话。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3338", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我该回去工作了……你回家路上小心喔。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "_mu3339", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 161, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没办法借她。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 162, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果是在和纱凪交往前，我一定会借的。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 163, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这也是我的变化吗？", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 164, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "交往后的改变，就是指这种事吗？", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 165, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不懂了。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 166, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我怀抱着不知道是对谁的罪恶感，与学姐分开了。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 167, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好想听纱凪的声音。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
